==Abilities ==
Harlekin attacks using its sharp claws, and it appears to be fairly strong and fairly agile. Like [[Marauder]], Harlekin draws power on its Seeker's negative emotions, being fuelled by fear. It is also able to jump from place to place quickly. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}

